<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia May palm oil output up 6.6 pct - MOPGC.</title>
<headline>Malaysia May palm oil output up 6.6 pct - MOPGC.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malaysian Oil Palm Growers' Council (MOPGC) has estimated Malaysia's crude palm oil output in May at 782,000 tonnes, up 6.6 percent from April, traders who obtained the data said on Monday.</p>
<p>Private crop forecaster Ivan Wong had estimated May production at 780,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority is due to release official May crop data at 0430 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206-2323)</p>
